Derived from the original project (copied or adapted, import paths changed):

  - internal/llm/                         vendor-neutral request/response model
  - internal/api/openai/{chat,responses}/ OpenAI HTTP codecs
  - internal/api/common/                  shared content/error helpers
  - internal/adapter/devin/               request assembly, tool-description
                                          workaround, response frame decoder
  - internal/app/                         routing and request lifecycle (trimmed)
  - internal/config/, internal/debuglog/  configuration and debug logging
                                          (trimmed)
  - the protocol knowledge recorded in docs/upstream-protocol.md, which
    originates from the original project's protobuf descriptor extraction
    work (cmd/protoextract).

New in this fork:

  - internal/connect/                     hand-written Connect protocol client
  - internal/adapter/devin/wire.go        hand-written protobuf wire codec
  - internal/adapter/devin/types.go       minimal upstream message definitions
  - internal/app/app_upstream_test.go      fake-upstream end-to-end tests
  - internal/connect/connect_test.go       framing/error/gzip tests
  - cmd/fieldcheck/                        upstream field-number guard
  - docs/architecture.png, docs/banner.png, README rewrite

The upstream Devin/Windsurf protocol is proprietary and undocumented. This
project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by Devin, Windsurf,
Codeium, or Cognition. It accesses the upstream service with a user-provided
session token; use it only in accordance with the upstream terms of service.
